<title>NETHERLANDS: ASMI wins $10 million Japan order.</title>
<headline>ASMI wins $10 million Japan order.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch semiconductor equipment maker ASM International has received an order which it values at over $10 million from a &quot;major&quot; Japanese wafer manufacturer, the company said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It did not identify the Japanese company.</p>
<p>Deliveries of the order are scheduled to begin in the third quarter of this year, with completion in the first quarter of 1998.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
